                            	  2672: LAB_1AFA
01:00000E50 4A2B41E3        	  2673: 	TST.b	comp_f(a3)			* test compare function flag
01:00000E54 663C            	  2674: 	BNE.s	LAB_1B2A			* branch if compare function
                            	  2675: 
