01:000028B2 4A2B41B5        	  7426: 	TST.b	Dtypef(a3)			* test data type
01:000028B6 6B00DA1E        	  7427: 	BMI		LAB_TMER			* if string do Type missmatch Error/warm start
                            	  7428: 
